      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Watchdog: STOP or MAINTENANCE => no launch; absent SYSTEM_AUTOSTART_ALLOWED => no launch.\nHQ CLI owns a subset of components. External APIs remain network dependencies; secrets are never diagram payloads.",
      "originalText": "Watchdog: STOP or MAINTENANCE => no launch; absent SYSTEM_AUTOSTART_ALLOWED => no launch.\nHQ CLI owns a subset of components. External APIs remain network dependencies; secrets are never diagram payloads.",
